OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'gobsmacked' by    
OL,4,ABurnham's devolution calls rejection   
OL,6,FWelsh secretary Stephen Kinnock said   
OL,7,Fthe changes would have led to          
OL,8,F"destabilisation and fragmentation and 
OL,9,Fdisintegration".                       
